OL,3,ANvidia shares slip as Trump's role in
OL,4,AJensen Huang's comeback questioned by
OL,5,AUS politicians
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Trump's role in Jensen
OL,8,FHuang's comeback as Nvidia boss has
OL,9,Fbeen questioned by some US politicians
OL,10,Fon both sides - what did they say?
OL,12,FTrump says he "made the deal" to bring
OL,13,FHuang back to the AI giant - but one
OL,14,Fsenior Democrat tells the BBC: "Under
OL,15,Fno circumstances should a president of
OL,16,Fthe United States be meddling in a
OL,17,Fcorporate board of directors' decision"
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
