OL,3,ANvidia shares slip as Trump's role in
OL,4,AJensen Huang's comeback questioned by
OL,5,AUS politicians
OL,6,
OL,7,FHuang resigned after admitting to an
OL,8,Faffair with an alleged Chinese spy - he
OL,9,Fwas also accused of an affair with a
OL,10,Fcolleague. Here's a timeline of how we
OL,11,Fgot here
OL,13,FNvidia shares are down as the US
OL,14,Fmarkets open, after jumping by a
OL,15,Fmassive 31% minutes after Huang's
OL,16,Freturn on Monday
OL,18,FTrump has bought millions of dollars in
OL,19,FNvidia stock in the past two years,
OL,20,Falthough the White House says he
OL,21,Fdoesn't manage his own trades
